lzfse: lzfse (LZFSE compression library and tool)
lzfse:
lzfse: LZFSE is a Lempel-Ziv style data compression algorithm from Apple,
lzfse: using Finite State Entropy coding. It targets a compression ratio
lzfse: comparable to zlib at much higher speed.
lzfse:
lzfse: On Slackware for Apple Silicon it is a dependency of asahi-fwextract,
lzfse: which uses it to unpack Apple's LZFSE-compressed firmware images.
lzfse:
lzfse: Homepage: https://github.com/lzfse/lzfse
lzfse: Needed by asahi-fwupdate, to rebuild the EFI partition's firmware.
